OSV offline vulnerability databases (osv-snapshot-<date> releases of this repository)

The osv-snapshot-<sha256>.tar.gz assets republish, unmodified, the per-ecosystem OSV database archives from
https://osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com/<ECOSYSTEM>/all.zip (https://osv.dev, operated by Google).
Each archive aggregates advisories from upstream databases under their own licences:

- RustSec Advisory Database (crates.io), https://github.com/rustsec/advisory-db
  Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0); dedicated to the public domain.
- Python Packaging Advisory Database (PyPI), https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0).
- Go Vulnerability Database (Go), https://github.com/golang/vulndb (data served at https://vuln.go.dev)
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0).
- GitHub Advisory Database (GHSA records carried in the OSV archives), https://github.com/github/advisory-database
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0).

